the prompt explicitly says this is static review, no tools. So no tool calls. Good — I have no SQL/bash tools available anyway in this environment? Actually I do have some tools but the task says static review without tools. Just answer.\n\nOne more check — 表名复数? No. 拼音? No. 泛化词? No. 方/人区分? N/A. 注释圆括号? No comments. OK.\n\nAlso — should the amount DEFAULT be quoted '0.00'? Not a spec item. Skip.\n\nData row length: tiny. Fine.\n\nField count ≤ 40: fine.\n\nSo final DETECTED line:\nDETECTED: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 必含字段缺失; 逻辑删除字段缺失; 字段未设NOT NULL及默认值\n\nCategory phrasing — keep short: 「NOT NULL及默认值缺失」 maybe better matching style. Or 「字段可空无默认值」. The example style: 「禁用类型」「索引命名不规范」「表注释缺失」. So: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 必含字段缺失; 逻辑删除字段缺失; NOT NULL及默认值缺失. Good.\n\nLet me write a suggested corrected DDL? The instruction says list issues + 修改建议 per item. A full corrected DDL is helpful but \"输出优先给diff或修改摘要\" per repo rules. I'll give a compact corrected DDL as the aggregated fix — that's useful and grounded. But careful: I must not over-assert team-standard types for the four audit fields. I'll present them as 建议模板. That's acceptable.\n\nAlso should I flag that there is no index on order_no? No — EXPLAIN territory. In 深度交互 I can mention: order_no 建议配 uk_/ix_ 索引并 EXPLAIN 验证（需运行时）— as a note, not a detected violation.\n\nFormat: markdown, Chinese, two sections, table for issues. Keep terse. Final DETECTED line must be standalone at end — \"最后必须单独输出一行汇总\". The 深度交互 section... hmm, the DETECTED line must be the last line (\"最后必须单独输出一行\"). Conflict with 2-part structure? I'll put 直接执行, then 深度交互, and the DETECTED line as the very last standalone line. The DETECTED line belongs to the deliverable; placing it after 深度交互 as final line satisfies both.\n\nActually cleaner: 直接执行 section contains issues + DETECTED line, then 深度交互, and repeat? No — repetition risks. The spec says \"最后必须单独输出一行汇总\" — strict: it must be at the end. I'll do 直接执行 (report), 深度交互 (challenge), then final line DETECTED. That satisfies