用类型无法判定：规范文档未给出禁用类型清单（在 steering/database-design-specification.md，本次未提供），故 `remark text` 未按「禁用类型」报，只按 NOT NULL/默认值规则报。若 steering 规范禁用 text，则该项升级。XY 检查点。\n- 索引有效性属运行时验证：order_no 作为业务编号却无任何二级索引（uk_/ix_），静态无法判定违规，但落库前应补唯一/普通索引并 EXPLAIN 验证。\n- 本应为脚本流程（ddl_check.py），本次静态人工核对已覆盖清单全部可静态判定项。\n\nDETECTED: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 必含字段缺失; 逻辑删除字段缺失; NOT NULL及默认值缺失\n\nWait — should 状态 enum-style comment for status be included in my suggested DDL? I wrote `COMMENT '状态[...]'` — that's a placeholder... \"NEVER deliver unfinished work: stubs, placeholders\". Hmm, but the status enum values are business-dependent — I don't know them. I'll write 注释按实际枚举补充 e.g. '订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付...]' — the manual rules doc itself uses that as the example of necessary bracketed supplement. Better: write `COMMENT '订单状态[值-含义按业务枚举补全]'`? That's still placeholder-ish. Alternative: just note \"status 注释须带枚举说明\". Simpler: in suggested DDL use a concrete-but-marked example? Hmm.\n\nSince the original DDL has no comment at all, and I don't know business enums, the honest approach: suggest `COMMENT '订单状态[10-xx,20-xx]'` with note that 枚举值须按业务补全. The manual rules explicitly endorse 「订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付,30-已完成]」 as necessary supplement. I could use that exact endorsed example but that fabricates business semantics. I'll write 注释格式如「状态[10-待支付,20-已支付]」，枚举值以实际业务为准 — put it as a note outside the DDL, and in DDL use `COMMENT '订单状态'`... no wait, plain '订单状态' without enum is arguably incomplete per 注释质量 example. Ugh.\n\nCleanest: in the reference DDL keep `COMMENT '订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付]'` — no, fabrication of business meaning.\n\nDecision: In reference DDL, write `status ... COMMENT '状态'`? The 规范 example says 「订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付,30-已完成]」是必要的 — implying status-type comments SHOULD have enums. So my suggestion would itself violate if I put bare '状态'. I'll put a footnote: status/del_flag 等枚举字段注释须含枚举说明，格式如「订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付]」，具体值按业务确定. And in the DDL block use `COMMENT '订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付]'` labeled as 示例值按实际业务替换. That's transparent, not a hidden stub. Fine — one short bracket note.\n\nActually, simpler and cleaner: make the reference DDL minimal-risk — only include comments that are fully determined: id/order_no/audit fields/del_flag are all determined. For status/amount/remark use determined generic comments: amount → '金额'? Hmm is 金额 enough — 内容视角. Fine. status → needs enum note. remark → '备注'. So only status has the caveat. Good.\n\nAlso should the correction include ENGINE/CHARSET? Not in spec; adding could conflict with team standard. Leave out — actually without ENGINE the table gets server default which might be MyISAM on old MySQL... but spec doesn't mention it; not my call. Add note? No — 只报告可判定违规. Skip ENGINE entirely in DDL? If I write reference DDL I might include just COMMENT='订单明细表' without engine to avoid inventing standards. Yes.\n\nAlso note `status tinyint DEFAULT '0'` — quoted '0'; my fix uses unquoted 0. Minor, fine.\n\nShould create_time be `datetime` or `timestamp`? Unknown from provided docs; I'll note 类型以团队标准为准 (bigint/datetime 为常见模板). OK.\n\nAlso one consideration on field order/conventions — not specified. Fine.\n\nLength check for the whole answer — keep it tight per tone guidance. Table + DDL + brief notes + 深度交互 + DETECTED line.\n\nOne more pass on determinable violations — anything I missed?\n\n- 属性级别命名: `amount` on order_detail — 属性级别? The example rule: 订单表字段不能叫 order. amount is fine.\n- 内容视角命名: fine.\n- 泛化词: none (no 「关联」「业务」).\n- 方/人区分: none present.\n- 表名主体: t_order_detail — 主体是 order, detail 限定明细实体, fine.\n- 复数: none.\n- 字符串长度: order_no varchar(32) — can't judge remark (text). fine.\n- 行长度: fine.\n- 禁用语句: none.\n- 索引命名: only PK. fine.\n- 必含 id: has id ✓.\n- AUTO_INCREMENT bigint PK: fine.\n\nConfirmed 5 categories.\n\nFor the issue table, cite rule sources precisely (清单第N条 / 手册章节). Good.\n\nWrite final answer in Chinese. Format: two required sections + final DETECTED line.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## 1. 直接执行：DDL 静态审查报告\n\n审查对象：`example.sql` 中的 `t_order_detail`（共 1 张表）。依据：`ddl-guard` SKILL.md 审查清单 + `ddl-manual-rules.md`。以下为可静态判定的全部违规。\n\n| # | 对象 | 违反规则 | 问题 | 修改建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 表 `t_order_detail` | 表注释缺失（清单第2条） | 语句无 `COMMENT=` 表注释 | 补表注释，≤64字符，如 `COMMENT='订单明细表'` |\n| 2 | `id`/`order_no`/`remark`/`amount`/`status` | 字段注释缺失（清单第4条） | 5 个字段全部无 COMMENT | 逐字段补注释，≤128字符、无全角、与字段名词汇对应（如 `order_no`→「订单编号」而非「订单号」）；`status` 注释须带枚举说明，格式如「订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付]」 |\n| 3 | 表 `t_order_detail` | 必含字段缺失（清单第6条） | 仅有 `id`，缺 `creator_id`、`create_time`、`last_updater_id`、`last_update_time` | 补齐 4 个标准字段（模板见下方参考 DDL） |\n| 4 | 表 `t_order_detail` | 逻辑删除字段缺失（清单第7条） | 无 `del_flag` | 加 `del_flag tinyint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '删除标志[0-否,1-是]'` |\n| 5 | `status`/`amount`/`remark` | 字段未设 NOT NULL/默认值（清单第10条，设计合理性·推荐级） | `status`、`amount` 可空；`remark` 可空且 text 列在 MySQL 无法设默认值，与「NOT NULL+默认值」直接冲突 | `status`、`amount` 补 `NOT NULL`；`remark` 改为 `varchar(N) NOT NULL DEFAULT ''`（N 按实际内容长度定） |\n\n参考修正（审计字段类型为通用模板，以 `steering/database-design-specification.md` 为准）：\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE t_order_detail (\n    id bigint NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT COMMENT '主键id',\n    order_no varchar(32) NOT NULL COMMENT '订单编号',\n    amount decimal(10,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0.00' COMMENT '金额',\n    status tinyint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '订单状态[枚举值按业务补全]',\n    remark varchar(500) NOT NULL DEFAULT '' COMMENT '备注',\n    del_flag tinyint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '删除标志[0-否,1-是]',\n    creator_id bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '创建人id',\n    create_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '创建时间',\n    last_updater_id bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '最后更新人id',\n    last_update_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '最后更新时间',\n    PRIMARY KEY (id)\n) COMMENT='订单明细表';\n```\n\n未检出项（已核对、合规）：表名/字段命名（主体明确、英文、无拼音/泛化词/复数）；无 `CREATE TRIGGER`/`PROCEDURE`/`VIEW`/`FUNCTION`；索引仅 `PRIMARY KEY`，不涉及 `ix_`/`uk_` 命名违规；单行长度远低于 8020 字节；字段数 ≤ 40。\n\n## 2. 深度交互\n\n- **禁用类型无法判定是本次审查的盲区**：禁用类型清单在 `steering/database-design-specification.md`（本次未提供），故 `remark text` 未按「禁用类型」上报，仅按 NOT NULL/默认值规则处理。若 steering 规范禁用 text/blob，第 5 条应升级为强制级——建议后续把禁用类型清单内联到 SKILL 可见文档，消除此类歧义。\n- **`order_no` 无任何二级索引**：作为业务编号却只有主键，静态无法判定为违规（索引有效性属 EXPLAIN 运行时验证），但落库前应补 `uk_order_no` 或 `ix_order_no` 并 EXPLAIN 确认，否则必然全表扫描。\n- 本任务设计上应由 `ddl_check.py` 先跑（可覆盖禁用类型/必含字段/del_flag/索引命名），本次静态人工核对已覆盖清单中全部可静态判定项，等价性成立。\n\nDETECTED: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 必含字段缺失; 逻辑删除字段缺失; NOT NULL及默认值缺失"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zhipu-coding-plan","model":"glm-5.3","usage":{"input":13313,"output":7452,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20765,"reasoningTokens":6360,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787582805692,"responseId":"202608242246453861ffeeff304231","duration":122675.729917,"ttft":5528.53675},"toolResults":[]}
{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<file name=\"/var/folders/zn/w06grcb53sl3spdn751tgsx80000gn/T/tmpbv2mq025/prompt.md\">\n你是数据库规范审查专家。请审查下面的 MySQL 建表语句（DDL），找出所有违反数据库设计规范的问题。\n用户原话：「帮我审查这个建表语句，看看有没有规范问题。」\n本次为静态审查：你不具备任何工具、不能执行任何脚本，请仅基于你掌握的规范知识逐条判断。\n\n输出要求：\n1. 逐条列出确实违反规范的问题（表名/端点/字段名、违反的规则、修改建议）。\n2. 只报告可判定的规范违规，不要输出泛泛的优化建议。\n3. 最后必须单独输出一行汇总，格式严格为：\nDETECTED: 规则类别1; 规则类别2; ...\n   每个规则类别用简短中文短语（如「禁用类型」「索引命名不规范」「表注释缺失」），用分号分隔；\n   若未发现任何问题，输出 DETECTED: NONE\n\n以下是本团队该领域的审查规范（审查依据，请严格按此逐条核对）：\n\n===== 规范文档 1/2: skills/ddl-guard/SKILL.md =====\n---\nname: ddl-guard\ndescription: >\n  数据库设计规范与检查，包括审查DDL、建表语句、表结构设计、字段设计、索引设计、MySQL建表、\n  审查Mapper SQL、PO类规范、数据库规范检查、SQL审核、数据库设计审查。\n  提供两类能力：(1) 按规范设计新表，(2) 用脚本审查 DDL 文件和 MyBatis SQL 合规性。\n---\n\n# MySQL DDL 设计与审查\n\n## 审查工作流\n\n严格按以下步骤执行。\n\n### 第 1 步：运行检查脚本\n\n脚本位于本 SKILL.md 同级的 `scripts/` 子目录，以本文件所在路径为基准定位：\n\n```bash\n# DDL 审查（.sql 建表语句）\npython3 scripts/ddl_check.py [--format json]\n\n# MyBatis SQL 审查（*Mapper.xml + @TableName PO 类，Java 项目）\npython3 scripts/sql_check.py [--format json]\n```\n\n- 退出码：`0`=通过，`1`=有强制问题，`2`=运行错误\n- `sql_check.py` 自动扫描 mapper XML（解析 `<if>`/`<where>`/`<foreach>` 等动态标签和 `<include>` 引用）以及 MyBatis-Plus `@TableName` 注解的 PO 类（检查表名/字段命名规范、必含字段）\n\n### 第 2 步：读取待审查文件\n\n脚本自动扫描全部文件后，按以下原则读取：\n\n- 小文件直接 `Read` 全文\n- 大文件先用 `Read` 带 `limit` 参数看头部（DDL 的 CREATE TABLE 语句通常集中在文件前半部分）\n- 仅问题密集且需要上下文判断的文件才扩大读取范围\n\n> 优先使用 `codebase-memory-mcp` 的 `search_graph` / `get_code_snippet` 定位 SQL 文件和 PO 类。\n> 优先使用 `smart_outline` 查看结构。\n\n### 第 3 步：补充人工判断\n\n读取以下文档，逐表核对脚本无法覆盖的规则：\n\n- DDL 审查 → [`ddl-manual-rules.md`](ddl-manual-rules.md)\n- SQL 审查 → [`sql-manual-rules.md`](sql-manual-rules.md)\n\n### 第 4 步：输出报告\n\n将脚本自动检查结果与人工判断合并，输出完整审查报告。\n\n## 设计新表\n\n读取 [`../../steering/database-design-specification.md`](../../steering/database-design-specification.md) 后按规范生成 DDL，再用上述脚本自检。\n\n\n===== 规范文档 2/2: skills/ddl-guard/ddl-manual-rules.md =====\n# DDL 脚本无法检查的规则\n\n以下规则 `ddl_check.py` 无法自动检查，审查时需逐表人工判断。\n\n## 命名语义【强制】\n\n| 规则 | 要点 | 操作指引 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 属性级别命名 | 字段名细化到属性级别，不得用主体名当属性名（如订单表字段不能叫 `order`） | 审查时检查每个字段名是否细化到具体属性。例如订单表中有 `order_no`（订单编号）、`buyer_id`（买家id），不应有 `order` 字段 |\n| 内容视角命名 | 以存储内容含义命名，而非业务功能/逻辑视角 | 审查字段名是否反映存储内容的实际含义。例如存储\"手机号\"应叫 `mobile_no` 而非 `contact_method`（业务视角） |\n| 泛化词 | 避免「关联」「业务」等无信息量词汇，有更精确的词则替换 | 审查表名和字段名是否包含「关联」「业务」等泛化词。例如 `order_business_rel` 应改为 `order_business_mapping`，`associate_id` 应改为具体业务含义的字段名 |\n| 方/人区分 | 专指人用 `er`（中文名「xx人」），含机构用 `pty`（中文名「xx方」） | 审查涉及「人」和「方」的字段名。例如「联系人」用 `contact_er`，「合作方」用 `partner_pty` |\n| 拼音 | 表名/字段名使用英文单词/缩写，禁止拼音或拼音缩写 | 审查所有表名和字段名是否为英文。发现拼音（如 `chanpin_mingcheng`、`danpai_jixiao`）立即要求改为英文 |\n| 表名主体 | 表名围绕核心主体设计 | 审查表名是否围绕核心业务主体。例如 `order_process_log` 应改为 `order_log` 或 `order_event`，核心主体是 order 而非 process |\n\n## 注释质量【强制】\n\n| 规则 | 要点 | 操作指引 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 补充信息必要性 | 圆括号内容须为必要补充；冗余或让含义混淆的不写 | 审查注释中圆括号内容是否为必要补充。例如「订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付,30-已完成]」是必要的，但「订单编号(订单号)」中括号内容冗余，应改为「订单编号」 |\n| 字段与注释对应 | 字段名与注释含义对应、词汇对应 | 审查字段名和注释是否语义一致。例如字段 `contact_mobile` 注释应为「联系人手机号」而非「联系手机」，字段 `order_no` 注释应为「订单编号」而非「订单号」 |\n\n## 设计合理性【推荐】\n\n| 规则 | 要点 | 操作指引 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 复数形式 | 表名/字段名不使用名词复数（如不加 s） | 审查表名和字段名是否使用了名词复数形式。例如 `user_orders` 应改为 `user_order`，`biz_lines` 应改为 `biz_line` |\n| 字符串长度 | 长度以实际内容为准、够用即可 | 审查 varchar/char 长度是否合理。例如 `varchar(500)` 存储简短字段应改为 `varchar(200)` 或更小 |\n| 数据行长度 | 单行不超过 8020 字节 | 估算表所有字段长度总和，确保不超过 8020 字节（MySQL InnoDB 行格式限制） |\n| NOT NULL + 默认值 | 字段尽量设 NOT NULL 并指定默认值 | 审查每个字段是否设置了 NOT NULL 和合理的默认值。例如 `varchar` 字段默认值应为 `''`，`tinyint` 字段默认值应为 `0` 或业务默认值 |\n\n## 禁用语句【强制】\n\n脚本只解析 `CREATE TABLE`，以下语句类型不会被检出：\n\n| 规则 | 要点 | 操作指引 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 触发器 | 不得使用 `CREATE TRIGGER` | 审查 DDL 文件中是否包含 `CREATE TRIGGER` 语句，发现立即要求移除 |\n| 存储过程 | 不得使用 `CREATE PROCEDURE` | 审查 DDL 文件中是否包含 `CREATE PROCEDURE` 语句，发现立即要求移除 |\n| 视图/自定义函数 | 【推荐】不使用，确需时须经技术管理委员会评审 | 审查 DDL 文件中是否包含 `CREATE VIEW` 或 `CREATE FUNCTION` 语句。确需使用时，需提交技术管理委员会评审 |\n\n## 需运行时验证【强制】\n\n| 规则 | 要点 | 操作指引 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 索引有效性 | 索引字段须与查询条件一致，需 EXPLAIN 验证 | 1. 列出所有索引及其字段<br>2. 找出使用该索引的 SQL 查询<br>3. 对每个查询执行 `EXPLAIN` 或 `EXPLAIN ANALYZE`<br>4. 确认 `type` 列不为 `ALL`（全表扫描）<br>5. 确认 `key` 列确实使用了预期索引<br>6. 确认 `rows` 列与预期扫描行数一致 |\n\n## 审查清单（逐表核对）\n\n对每张表，按以下顺序逐条核对：\n\n1. **表名**：是否围绕核心主体？是否使用英文？是否无拼音？是否无泛化词？是否无复数？\n2. **表注释**：是否完整？是否 ≤ 64 字符？是否无特殊字符？\n3. **字段名**：是否细化到属性级别？是否使用英文？是否无拼音？是否无泛化词？是否无复数？\n4. **字段注释**：是否完整？是否 ≤ 128 字符？是否无全角字符？是否与字段名语义对应？\n5. **字段类型**：是否使用禁用类型？（脚本已检查）\n6. **必含字段**：是否包含 id/creator_id/create_time/last_updater_id/last_update_time？（脚本已检查）\n7. **逻辑删除**：是否统一使用 `del_flag`？注释格式是否为 `删除标志[0-否,1-是]`？（脚本已检查）\n8. **索引**：命名是否符合 `ix_`/`uk_` 规范？（脚本已检查）\n9. **索引有效性**：是否通过 EXPLAIN 验证？（需人工运行）\n10. **设计合理性**：字段数量 ≤ 40？单行 ≤ 8020 字节？NOT NULL + 默认值？字符串长度合理？\n\n待审查内容如下：\n----- 文件 example.sql 开始 -----\nCREATE TABLE t_order_detail (\n    id bigint NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n    order_no varchar(32) NOT NULL,\n    remark text,\n    amount decimal(10,2) DEFAULT '0.00',\n    status tinyint DEFAULT '0',\n    PRIMARY KEY (id)\n);\n\n----- 文件 example.sql 结束 -----\n开始审查。\n</file>\n"}],"attribution":"user","timestamp":1787582805641},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to review a MySQL DDL statement against the given specification documents. This is a static review task — no tools available, just knowledge-based judgment based on the two spec documents provided.\n\nLet me carefully review the DDL:\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE t_order_detail (\n    id bigint NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n    order_no varchar(32) NOT NULL,\n    remark text,\n    amount decimal(10,2) DEFAULT '0.00',\n    status tinyint DEFAULT '0',\n    PRIMARY KEY (id)\n);\n```\n\nThe review basis:\n- Document 1: SKILL.md workflow — mentions script checks (禁用类型, 必含字段, 逻辑删除 del_flag, 索引命名 ix_/uk_, etc.)\n- Document 2: ddl-manual-rules.md — manual rules\n\nThe SKILL.md references script-checked rules:\n- 字段类型禁用类型\n- 必含字段: id/creator_id/create_time/last_updater_id/last_update_time\n- 逻辑删除: del_flag with 注释 `删除标志[0-否,1-是]`\n- 索引命名 ix_/uk_ 规范\n- 表注释 (from the checklist: 表注释是否完整 ≤64字符)\n- 字段注释 (字段注释是否完整 ≤128字符)\n\nSince this is a static review, I need to apply all rules based on the checklist in ddl-manual-rules.md which includes script-checked items too (items 5-8 are script checked but I must judge them manually here since no script).\n\nLet me go through the checklist for `t_order_detail`:\n\n1. **表名**: `t_order_detail` — 围绕核心主体, English, no pinyin, no 泛化词, no plural. ✓ OK\n\n2. **表注释**: NO table comment! `COMMENT` clause missing entirely. → 表注释缺失 violation. Also no `COMMENT='...'` table option.\n\n3. **字段名**: \n   - `id` ✓\n   - `order_no` ✓ (订单编号, good)\n   - `remark` ✓\n   - `amount` — hmm, is this 细化到属性级别? `amount` on an order detail table... The table is order detail, amount could be `order_amount`? Actually the rule says 字段名细化到属性级别，不得用主体名当属性名. `amount` is generic but not the subject name. Borderline — I'd probably not flag it as a hard violation since the example given is about using the subject name as field name (`order` field in order table). But \"amount\" vs \"order_amount\"... The rule example: 订单表中有 order_no（订单编号）、buyer_id（买家id），不应有 order 字段. So `amount` doesn't violate the 主体名 rule. I won't flag it.\n   - `status` — similar, generic but acceptable? `status` on order_detail... could be `order_status`? Again, borderline. The rule is specifically about not using subject name as attribute name. `status` is an attribute name. Not a violation per the stated rule.\n\n4. **字段注释**: NO field comments at all! All fields lack COMMENT. → 字段注释缺失 violation.\n\n5. **字段类型**: 禁用类型 — the spec mentions 禁用类型 (script checked). What are typically 禁用类型 in these specs? Common ones: float, double (浮点类型 for precision), enum, set, bit... and `text` is often restricted/discouraged? Hmm. The manual rules say under 字符串长度: 审查 varchar/char 长度. The 禁用类型 list isn't explicitly enumerated in the provided docs. Common MySQL specs forbid: float/double, enum, set, bit, and sometimes text/blob are discouraged (需评估) — but since the exact disabled type list isn't in the provided docs, I can't definitively flag `text` as a 禁用类型.\n\nWait — but `remark text` — many specs do disable text unless necessary. But the provided documents don't enumerate 禁用类型. The prompt says \"只报告可判定的规范违规\". Since the 禁用类型 list is not provided, I cannot definitively say `text` violates it. Hmm. But actually, let me think again. The description mentions \"禁用类型\" as an example category in the output format example: 「禁用类型」「索引命名不规范」「表注释缺失」. These are example category names, suggesting they're common outputs.\n\nThe spec doc references `../../steering/database-design-specification.md` for the full spec, which isn't provided. So strictly, I can only judge based on what's given. The checklist item 5 says \"字段类型：是否使用禁用类型？（脚本已检查）\" — but since I don't have the script or the disabled type list, I can't definitively determine. However, `text` is a well-known questionable type. Hmm.\n\nActually wait — for `remark`, using `text` is common. The manual rule says 字符串长度以实际内容为准. A remark field as text — many specs require varchar instead of text because text can't have default, stored off-page etc. But without the explicit disabled list, flagging it is risky. The instruction: \"只报告可判定的规范违规，不要输出泛泛的优化建议\". So I should only report what's clearly determinable.\n\n6. **必含字段**: The table must include id/creator_id/create_time/last_updater_id/last_update_time. The table has only `id` — missing creator_id, create_time, last_updater_id, last_update_time. → 必含字段缺失 violation. This is clearly checkable.\n\n7. **逻辑删除**: Missing `del_flag` with comment `删除标志[0-否,1-是]`. The checklist says \"是否统一使用 del_flag\" — is del_flag required in every table? Item 7 says 是否统一使用 del_flag — implies the table should have del_flag. Missing → violation. This is part of 必含字段 essentially. Hmm, but is del_flag mandatory for every table? The checklist item 7 asks about it for every table, and item 6's 必含字段 list doesn't include del_flag. The script checks \"逻辑删除：是否统一使用 del_flag？注释格式\". Given the checklist explicitly asks per-table, missing del_flag would be a violation of 统一逻辑删除规范. I'll include it — it's determinable: table has no logical delete field at all while the spec mandates uniform del_flag usage.\n\nActually, let me be careful. Rule 7: \"逻辑删除：是否统一使用 del_flag？注释格式是否为 删除标志[0-否,1-是]？（脚本已检查）\". This implies the team standard is unified logical deletion via del_flag. A table without del_flag violates \"统一使用 del_flag\". Yes, flag it.\n\n8. **索引命名**: Only PRIMARY KEY — no secondary indexes. No ix_/uk_ naming issue. But wait — should there be unique key on order_no? That's an index design/validity question requiring runtime verification (rule 9 需 EXPLAIN). Not statically determinable as violation. However — 缺少业务索引 might be flagged? No, \"只报告可判定的规范违规\". PRIMARY KEY is fine. No violation on naming. Hmm, but one could argue the table lacks any index on order_no which would be needed for queries — but that's EXPLAIN/runtime territory, not statically determinable. Skip.\n\n9. **索引有效性**: needs runtime — skip.\n\n10. **设计合理性** (推荐 rules):\n    - 复数形式: no plurals ✓\n    - 字符串长度: varchar(32) for order_no — fine. Can't judge remark text length.\n    - 数据行长度: sum well under 8020 ✓\n    - **NOT NULL + 默认值**: `remark text` is nullable with no default — violates \"字段尽量设 NOT NULL 并指定默认值\". Note: text/blob can't have defaults in MySQL (before 8.0.13 with expression defaults), so typically the fix is use varchar with NOT NULL DEFAULT ''. `remark text` → nullable, no default. This is a 推荐级 rule violation but still determinable. The checklist item 10 includes \"NOT NULL + 默认值？\". I'll flag it as the manual rules table includes it (设计合理性【推荐】). It IS a rule in the spec (recommended level). The prompt says report 规范违规 — recommended rules are still rules. I'll report it but can note it's 推荐 level. Hmm, \"只报告可判定的规范违规，不要输出泛泛的优化建议\" — NOT NULL+default is a specific rule, determinable. Report it.\n\nAlso:\n- `status tinyint DEFAULT '0'` — has default, but nullable (no NOT NULL). Violates NOT NULL + 默认值.\n- `amount decimal(10,2) DEFAULT '0.00'` — nullable, no NOT NULL. Violates NOT NULL + 默认值.\n- `order_no varchar(32) NOT NULL` — has NOT NULL but no default. Hmm, the rule says \"尽量设 NOT NULL 并指定默认值\". For business-required fields like order_no, NOT NULL without default is often acceptable... The rule example says varchar 字段默认值应为 ''. But for key business fields, no default makes sense. Strictly per rule \"尽量设 NOT NULL 并指定默认值\" — order_no lacks default. But adding DEFAULT '' to order_no would be bad practice (required field shouldn't have empty default). Hmm. I'll focus on the clear cases: status, amount, remark lack NOT NULL; remark lacks default. I can mention order_no has no default but that's typically intentional for required business fields. Actually to keep it precise: the rule violations are: status/amount/remark 缺 NOT NULL; remark 缺默认值(且 text 类型不适合)。\n\nLet me also check 表注释: `CREATE TABLE t_order_detail (` — no COMMENT= at end. Missing → violation.\n\n字段注释: none of the 5 fields have COMMENT → violation.\n\n必含字段: missing creator_id/create_time/last_updater_id/last_update_time → violation.\n\ndel_flag: missing → 逻辑删除字段缺失 violation.\n\n字段注释质量 rules (字段与注释对应 etc.) — moot since no comments at all; covered by 字段注释缺失.\n\nAUTO_INCREMENT on PK — fine, standard.\n\n`DEFAULT '0'` for tinyint — quoted numeric default, not a spec violation per given docs.\n\nCHARSET/engine not specified — not in the given spec docs, skip (只报告可判定).\n\nNow, what about `remark text`? Is text a 禁用类型? Not determinable from provided docs. But there's the 字符串长度 rule: 长度以实际内容为准. Not determinable. However the NOT NULL+default rule: text fields in MySQL cannot have a default (in 5.7), and the rule requires 默认值 — so remark as text can't satisfy NOT NULL + DEFAULT ''. The recommendation would be to convert to varchar(N) NOT NULL DEFAULT ''. I'll present it under the NOT NULL/default issue with the type note.\n\nLet me now also double check 表名 `t_order_detail`: 主体是 order? \"表名围绕核心主体设计\" — order_detail vs order: the example given is order_process_log → order_log, meaning modifier like \"process\" (action) is removed, but \"detail\" is a legitimate entity qualifier (订单明细表). t_ prefix is fine. Not a violation.\n\nFields: `amount` — hmm, one more consideration. 属性级别命名: on order_detail table, `amount` could be ambiguous (单价? 总额?). Should it be `order_amount`? The rule's example is about not using subject name as field name. `amount` is generic-ish but is an attribute. I won't flag — not determinable enough. Similarly `status` → could be `order_status`... The checklist item 3: 字段名是否细化到属性级别. \"status\" IS an attribute (状态), not subject name. The explicit rule: 不得用主体名当属性名. status doesn't use subject name. Not a violation. Keep it clean — don't flag.\n\nActually wait, let me reconsider `remark`. Not a violation either.\n\nNow what about missing `AUTO_INCREMENT` value or `unsigned`? Not in spec. Skip.\n\nMissing storage engine / charset declaration? Not in provided spec. Skip.\n\nSo the definitive violations:\n\n1. **表注释缺失** — `CREATE TABLE` 无 `COMMENT=` 表注释。(checklist item 2: 表注释完整). 【强制 per 注释质量?】Actually 表注释 rule is in checklist; the script checks it presumably. Violation determinable.\n\n2. **字段注释缺失** — 5 个字段全部无 COMMENT。(checklist item 4). \n\n3. **必含字段缺失** — 缺 creator_id/create_time/last_updater_id/last_update_time (only id present). (checklist item 6, script-checked rule).\n\n4. **逻辑删除字段缺失** — 无 del_flag，注释格式无从谈起. (checklist item 7).\n\n5. **NOT NULL + 默认值缺失** — status、amount 缺 NOT NULL；remark 缺 NOT NULL 和默认值（text 类型无法设默认值，建议改 varchar）. (checklist item 10, 设计合理性【推荐】).\n\nAnything else? 禁用类型 — text? Not enumerable from docs → skip to avoid false positives. 索引命名 — no secondary indexes, PK fine → no violation.\n\nHmm, one thing: should order_no have a uk_ index for uniqueness? Business-dependent; not determinable statically. Skip per instruction 2.\n\nWait, also consider: does the spec require a unique index on business key? Not stated. Skip.\n\nAlso `decimal(10,2) DEFAULT '0.00'` — decimal is a permitted type (推荐的金额类型). Fine.\n\n`tinyint` — fine.\n\nSo DETECTED categories: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 必含字段缺失; 逻辑删除字段缺失; 字段未设NOT NULL及默认值\n\nPer output format, each category should be a 简短中文短语. Examples given: 「禁用类型」「索引命名不规范」「表注释缺失」. \n\nMy list:\n- 表注释缺失\n- 字段注释缺失\n- 必含字段缺失\n- 逻辑删除字段缺失\n- NOT NULL及默认值缺失 (or 字段未设NOT NULL默认值)\n\nLet me structure per-table since one table:\n\n## t_order_detail\n\n| 位置 | 违反规则 | 说明 | 修改建议 |\n\n1. 表级 — 表注释缺失（审查清单第2条：表注释须完整、≤64字符）— 语句无 `COMMENT='订单明细表'`。建议：`) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COMMENT='订单明细表';`\n\nHmm wait — should I add ENGINE/CHARSET suggestion? That's not in the spec; only add COMMENT. Keep suggestion to comment.\n\n2. 全部字段 — 字段注释缺失（审查清单第4条）— id/order_no/remark/amount/status 均无 COMMENT。建议每个字段加 COMMENT，且 order_no 注释应为「订单编号」。\n\n3. 表级 — 必含字段缺失（审查清单第6条）— 缺 creator_id/create_time/last_updater_id/last_update_time。建议补齐：\n```sql\ncreator_id bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '创建人id',\ncreate_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '创建时间',\nlast_updater_id bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '最后更新人id',\nlast_update_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '最后更新时间',\n```\nHmm — I'm guessing the exact mandated types. The spec doesn't give exact types for these fields. I should suggest them but mark as typical. Since \"只报告可判定的规范违规\" — the violation is missing fields, determinable. The suggestion can be generic (按团队标准字段补齐). I'll give a reasonable template but note it follows team's standard required fields. Types: bigint/bigint, datetime. This is standard. Fine.\n\n4. 表级 — 逻辑删除字段缺失（审查清单第7条）— 无 `del_flag`。建议：`del_flag tinyint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '删除标志[0-否,1-是]'`.\n\n5. remark/status/amount — NOT NULL 与默认值（设计合理性，推荐级）— status、amount 可空且 remark 可空无默认；text 列无法设默认值，与「NOT NULL+默认值」要求冲突，建议 remark 改 varchar(N) NOT NULL DEFAULT ''。status → NOT NULL DEFAULT 0；amount → NOT NULL DEFAULT 0.00。\n\nAlso note order_no has NOT NULL but no default — the rule says varchar 默认值应为 ''。For a required business key field... Strictly, checklist asks \"NOT NULL + 默认值？\" for every field. Should I flag order_no missing default? Hmm. The rule: \"字段尽量设 NOT NULL 并指定默认值\". \"尽量\" = as much as possible. order_no is a NOT NULL business field without default — giving it DEFAULT '' would be wrong (weakens required semantics). The rule's intent is to avoid NULL; order_no already avoids NULL. I'll not flag order_no. Defensible.\n\nThe repo rules say all responses in Chinese-simplified, and must have 2 parts: 1. 直接执行; 2. 深度交互. The prompt.md is the task itself and says output the review report with DETECTED line. The user-level CLAUDE.md requires the 2-part structure. I'll comply: 直接执行 = the review; 深度交互 = brief challenge (e.g., this is static review; script couldn't run; index validity needs EXPLAIN; suggest fixing spec gaps like 禁用类型 list not enumerable from given docs — text 型 remark couldn't be judged as 禁用类型 without the steering doc). Keep it tight.\n\nAlso note: the prompt explicitly says this is static review, no tools. So no tool calls. Good — I have no SQL/bash tools available anyway in this environment? Actually I do have some tools but the task says static review without tools. Just answer.\n\nOne more check — 表名复数? No. 拼音? No. 泛化词? No. 方/人区分? N/A. 注释圆括号? No comments. OK.\n\nAlso — should the amount DEFAULT be quoted '0.00'? Not a spec item. Skip.\n\nData row length: tiny. Fine.\n\nField count ≤ 40: fine.\n\nSo final DETECTED line:\nDETECTED: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 必含字段缺失; 逻辑删除字段缺失; 字段未设NOT NULL及默认值\n\nCategory phrasing — keep short: 「NOT NULL及默认值缺失」 maybe better matching style. Or 「字段可空无默认值」. The example style: 「禁用类型」「索引命名不规范」「表注释缺失」. So: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 必含字段缺失; 逻辑删除字段缺失; NOT NULL及默认值缺失. Good.\n\nLet me write a suggested corrected DDL? The instruction says list issues + 修改建议 per item. A full corrected DDL is helpful but \"输出优先给diff或修改摘要\" per repo rules. I'll give a compact corrected DDL as the aggregated fix — that's useful and grounded. But careful: I must not over-assert team-standard types for the four audit fields. I'll present them as 建议模板. That's acceptable.\n\nAlso should I flag that there is no index on order_no? No — EXPLAIN territory. In 深度交互 I can mention: order_no 建议配 uk_/ix_ 索引并 EXPLAIN 验证（需运行时）— as a note, not a detected violation.\n\nFormat: markdown, Chinese, two sections, table for issues. Keep terse. Final DETECTED line must be standalone at end — \"最后必须单独输出一行汇总\". The 深度交互 section... hmm, the DETECTED line must be the last line (\"最后必须单独输出一行\"). Conflict with 2-part structure? I'll put 直接执行, then 深度交互, and the DETECTED line as the very last standalone line. The DETECTED line belongs to the deliverable; placing it after 深度交互 as final line satisfies both.\n\nActually cleaner: 直接执行 section contains issues + DETECTED line, then 深度交互, and repeat? No — repetition risks. The spec says \"最后必须单独输出一行汇总\" — strict: it must be at the end. I'll do 直接执行 (report), 深度交互 (challenge), then final line DETECTED. That satisfies \"最后单独输出一行\".\n\nHmm, but parsers/graders might expect DETECTED as the last line regardless of sections. Yes, final line.\n\nLet me draft:\n\n## 1. 直接执行：DDL 审查报告\n\n审查对象：`example.sql` → `t_order_detail`（1 张表）。规范依据：`skills/ddl-guard`（SKILL.md + ddl-manual-rules.md 审查清单）。\n\n| # | 对象 | 违反规则 | 问题描述 | 修改建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 表 `t_order_detail` | 表注释缺失（清单第2条） | 无 `COMMENT=` 表注释 | 补 `COMMENT='订单明细表'`（≤64字符） |\n| 2 | id/order_no/remark/amount/status | 字段注释缺失（清单第4条） | 5 个字段全部无 COMMENT | 逐字段补注释，≤128字符，与字段名语义对应（如 order_no → 订单编号） |\n| 3 | 表 `t_order_detail` | 必含字段缺失（清单第6条） | 仅有 id，缺 creator_id、create_time、last_updater_id、last_update_time | 补齐 4 个标准字段 |\n| 4 | 表 `t_order_detail` | 逻辑删除字段缺失（清单第7条） | 无 del_flag | 加 `del_flag tinyint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '删除标志[0-否,1-是]'` |\n| 5 | status/amount/remark | 字段未设 NOT NULL/默认值（清单第10条，推荐级） | status、amount 可空；remark 可空且 text 无默认值 | status 加 NOT NULL；amount 加 NOT NULL；remark 改 `varchar(N) NOT NULL DEFAULT ''`（text 无法设默认值，与规范冲突） |\n\nThen 参考修正 DDL (compact):\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE t_order_detail (\n    id bigint NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT COMMENT '主键id',\n    order_no varchar(32) NOT NULL COMMENT '订单编号',\n    amount decimal(10,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0.00' COMMENT '金额',\n    status tinyint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '状态[...]',\n    remark varchar(500) NOT NULL DEFAULT '' COMMENT '备注',\n    del_flag tinyint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '删除标志[0-否,1-是]',\n    creator_id bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '创建人id',\n    create_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '创建时间',\n    last_updater_id bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '最后更新人id',\n    last_update_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '最后更新时间',\n    PRIMARY KEY (id)\n) COMMENT='订单明细表';\n```\n\nNote: 4 个审计字段类型为通用模板，以 steering/database-design-specification.md 为准。\n\n判定说明：未检出项 — 表名/字段命名（主体、英文、无拼音/泛化词/复数）均合规；无 CREATE TRIGGER/PROCEDURE/VIEW/FUNCTION；索引仅 PRIMARY KEY，不涉及 ix_/uk_ 命名违规；行长度远低于 8020 字节。\n\n## 2. 深度交互\n\n- 禁用类型无法判定：规范文档未给出禁用类型清单（在 steering/database-design-specification.md，本次未提供），故 `remark text` 未按「禁用类型」报，只按 NOT NULL/默认值规则报。若 steering 规范禁用 text，则该项升级。XY 检查点。\n- 索引有效性属运行时验证：order_no 作为业务编号却无任何二级索引（uk_/ix_），静态无法判定违规，但落库前应补唯一/普通索引并 EXPLAIN 验证。\n- 本应为脚本流程（ddl_check.py），本次静态人工核对已覆盖清单全部可静态判定项。\n\nDETECTED: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 必含字段缺失; 逻辑删除字段缺失; NOT NULL及默认值缺失\n\nWait — should 状态 enum-style comment for status be included in my suggested DDL? I wrote `COMMENT '状态[...]'` — that's a placeholder... \"NEVER deliver unfinished work: stubs, placeholders\". Hmm, but the status enum values are business-dependent — I don't know them. I'll write 注释按实际枚举补充 e.g. '订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付...]' — the manual rules doc itself uses that as the example of necessary bracketed supplement. Better: write `COMMENT '订单状态[值-含义按业务枚举补全]'`? That's still placeholder-ish. Alternative: just note \"status 注释须带枚举说明\". Simpler: in suggested DDL use a concrete-but-marked example? Hmm.\n\nSince the original DDL has no comment at all, and I don't know business enums, the honest approach: suggest `COMMENT '订单状态[10-xx,20-xx]'` with note that 枚举值须按业务补全. The manual rules explicitly endorse 「订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付,30-已完成]」 as necessary supplement. I could use that exact endorsed example but that fabricates business semantics. I'll write 注释格式如「状态[10-待支付,20-已支付]」，枚举值以实际业务为准 — put it as a note outside the DDL, and in DDL use `COMMENT '订单状态'`... no wait, plain '订单状态' without enum is arguably incomplete per 注释质量 example. Ugh.\n\nCleanest: in the reference DDL keep `COMMENT '订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付]'` — no, fabrication of business meaning.\n\nDecision: In reference DDL, write `status ... COMMENT '状态'`? The 规范 example says 「订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付,30-已完成]」是必要的 — implying status-type comments SHOULD have enums. So my suggestion would itself violate if I put bare '状态'. I'll put a footnote: status/del_flag 等枚举字段注释须含枚举说明，格式如「订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付]」，具体值按业务确定. And in the DDL block use `COMMENT '订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付]'` labeled as 示例值按实际业务替换. That's transparent, not a hidden stub. Fine — one short bracket note.\n\nActually, simpler and cleaner: make the reference DDL minimal-risk — only include comments that are fully determined: id/order_no/audit fields/del_flag are all determined. For status/amount/remark use determined generic comments: amount → '金额'? Hmm is 金额 enough — 内容视角. Fine. status → needs enum note. remark → '备注'. So only status has the caveat. Good.\n\nAlso should the correction include ENGINE/CHARSET? Not in spec; adding could conflict with team standard. Leave out — actually without ENGINE the table gets server default which might be MyISAM on old MySQL... but spec doesn't mention it; not my call. Add note? No — 只报告可判定违规. Skip ENGINE entirely in DDL? If I write reference DDL I might include just COMMENT='订单明细表' without engine to avoid inventing standards. Yes.\n\nAlso note `status tinyint DEFAULT '0'` — quoted '0'; my fix uses unquoted 0. Minor, fine.\n\nShould create_time be `datetime` or `timestamp`? Unknown from provided docs; I'll note 类型以团队标准为准 (bigint/datetime 为常见模板). OK.\n\nAlso one consideration on field order/conventions — not specified. Fine.\n\nLength check for the whole answer — keep it tight per tone guidance. Table + DDL + brief notes + 深度交互 + DETECTED line.\n\nOne more pass on determinable violations — anything I missed?\n\n- 属性级别命名: `amount` on order_detail — 属性级别? The example rule: 订单表字段不能叫 order. amount is fine.\n- 内容视角命名: fine.\n- 泛化词: none (no 「关联」「业务」).\n- 方/人区分: none present.\n- 表名主体: t_order_detail — 主体是 order, detail 限定明细实体, fine.\n- 复数: none.\n- 字符串长度: order_no varchar(32) — can't judge remark (text). fine.\n- 行长度: fine.\n- 禁用语句: none.\n- 索引命名: only PK. fine.\n- 必含 id: has id ✓.\n- AUTO_INCREMENT bigint PK: fine.\n\nConfirmed 5 categories.\n\nFor the issue table, cite rule sources precisely (清单第N条 / 手册章节). Good.\n\nWrite final answer in Chinese. Format: two required sections + final DETECTED line.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## 1. 直接执行：DDL 静态审查报告\n\n审查对象：`example.sql` 中的 `t_order_detail`（共 1 张表）。依据：`ddl-guard` SKILL.md 审查清单 + `ddl-manual-rules.md`。以下为可静态判定的全部违规。\n\n| # | 对象 | 违反规则 | 问题 | 修改建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 表 `t_order_detail` | 表注释缺失（清单第2条） | 语句无 `COMMENT=` 表注释 | 补表注释，≤64字符，如 `COMMENT='订单明细表'` |\n| 2 | `id`/`order_no`/`remark`/`amount`/`status` | 字段注释缺失（清单第4条） | 5 个字段全部无 COMMENT | 逐字段补注释，≤128字符、无全角、与字段名词汇对应（如 `order_no`→「订单编号」而非「订单号」）；`status` 注释须带枚举说明，格式如「订单状态[10-待支付,20-已支付]」 |\n| 3 | 表 `t_order_detail` | 必含字段缺失（清单第6条） | 仅有 `id`，缺 `creator_id`、`create_time`、`last_updater_id`、`last_update_time` | 补齐 4 个标准字段（模板见下方参考 DDL） |\n| 4 | 表 `t_order_detail` | 逻辑删除字段缺失（清单第7条） | 无 `del_flag` | 加 `del_flag tinyint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '删除标志[0-否,1-是]'` |\n| 5 | `status`/`amount`/`remark` | 字段未设 NOT NULL/默认值（清单第10条，设计合理性·推荐级） | `status`、`amount` 可空；`remark` 可空且 text 列在 MySQL 无法设默认值，与「NOT NULL+默认值」直接冲突 | `status`、`amount` 补 `NOT NULL`；`remark` 改为 `varchar(N) NOT NULL DEFAULT ''`（N 按实际内容长度定） |\n\n参考修正（审计字段类型为通用模板，以 `steering/database-design-specification.md` 为准）：\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE t_order_detail (\n    id bigint NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT COMMENT '主键id',\n    order_no varchar(32) NOT NULL COMMENT '订单编号',\n    amount decimal(10,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0.00' COMMENT '金额',\n    status tinyint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '订单状态[枚举值按业务补全]',\n    remark varchar(500) NOT NULL DEFAULT '' COMMENT '备注',\n    del_flag tinyint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '删除标志[0-否,1-是]',\n    creator_id bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '创建人id',\n    create_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '创建时间',\n    last_updater_id bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT '最后更新人id',\n    last_update_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '最后更新时间',\n    PRIMARY KEY (id)\n) COMMENT='订单明细表';\n```\n\n未检出项（已核对、合规）：表名/字段命名（主体明确、英文、无拼音/泛化词/复数）；无 `CREATE TRIGGER`/`PROCEDURE`/`VIEW`/`FUNCTION`；索引仅 `PRIMARY KEY`，不涉及 `ix_`/`uk_` 命名违规；单行长度远低于 8020 字节；字段数 ≤ 40。\n\n## 2. 深度交互\n\n- **禁用类型无法判定是本次审查的盲区**：禁用类型清单在 `steering/database-design-specification.md`（本次未提供），故 `remark text` 未按「禁用类型」上报，仅按 NOT NULL/默认值规则处理。若 steering 规范禁用 text/blob，第 5 条应升级为强制级——建议后续把禁用类型清单内联到 SKILL 可见文档，消除此类歧义。\n- **`order_no` 无任何二级索引**：作为业务编号却只有主键，静态无法判定为违规（索引有效性属 EXPLAIN 运行时验证），但落库前应补 `uk_order_no` 或 `ix_order_no` 并 EXPLAIN 确认，否则必然全表扫描。\n- 本任务设计上应由 `ddl_check.py` 先跑（可覆盖禁用类型/必含字段/del_flag/索引命名），本次静态人工核对已覆盖清单中全部可静态判定项，等价性成立。\n\nDETECTED: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 必含字段缺失; 逻辑删除字段缺失; NOT NULL及默认值缺失"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zhipu-coding-plan","model":"glm-5.3","usage":{"input":13313,"output":7452,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20765,"reasoningTokens":6360,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787582805692,"responseId":"202608242246453861ffeeff304231","duration":122675.729917,"ttft":5528.53675}],"isTerminal":true}

